  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Incoming mission female entrepreneurs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">From November 2015 until June 2016, 21 female entrepreneurs from Zimbabwe participated in a training and mission programme. The training programme focused on personal development and improvement of the companies.The mission to the Netherlands was a learning journey and a trade mission. Some participating entrepreneurs have secured export leads and are preparing to export their products to the Netherlands. Others purchase technologically advanced and efficient equipment from the Netherlands, which significantly reduces their production costs.Most of them have benefited from ideas on new product development and are currently experimenting with research institutions on developing new products for the local market.</narrative>
  </description>
